cff-version: 1.2.0
title: TrustScore Atlas
message: >-
  If you use this software or the data packages it publishes, please cite both. The published data
  is licensed CC BY 4.0 and carries its own per-source attribution in each package's SOURCES.md.
type: software
abstract: >-
  TrustScore Atlas harmonises public business registers into one record per business, keeping the
  register that published each field and the date it said so, reporting what has not been checked
  as plainly as what has, and publishing deterministic evidence scores with explicit coverage.
authors:
